<title>USA: Ottawa Financial Corp Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Ottawa Financial Corp Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLAND, Mich. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.22   profit	$ 0.18</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,136   profit	   929</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 results include one-time charge of $3.51 million or $0.69/shr, pre-tax, for Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization. Excluding the charge, results were earnings of $1.4 million or $0.27/shr for the 1996 Q3 and earnings of $4.1 million or $0.79/shr for the nine months.  </p>
<p>		  9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.31   profit	 $0.52</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,617   profit	 2,744</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>Assets $827.3 million vs $344.3 million</p>
<p>Deposits $615.6 million vs $241.0 million</p>
<p>Loans receivable $684.7 million vs $258.2 million</p>
<p>NOTE: Assets, deposits and loan data not comparable. The company on February 13, 1996 acquired AmeriBank.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
